### Create Genially - Name exactly 3 characters (boundary - should pass)
POST {{baseUrl}}/genially
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": "{{$random.idNumber.valid}}",
  "name": "{{$randomAlphabetic(3)}}",
  "description": "{{$randomAlphabetic(100)}}"
}
> {%
